 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 3,
   "row": 87,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **SARFAESI 2016 amendment and Sec 13(4):** the creditor threshold for the Sec 13(2) notice was **75%** of dues before the **2016** amendment cut it to **60%**; under **Sec 13(4)** lenders may take **possession** of the secured asset, **take over management** or **sell** it."
  },
  {
   "book": 3,
   "row": 87,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **IBC concerns:** **deep haircuts** for lenders, **protracted litigation** that stretches timelines, and **NCLT capacity constraints** (too few benches and members); the Code has not removed guarantor liability."
  },
  {
   "book": 3,
   "row": 73,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **BRIC origin:** the term **BRIC** was coined by **Jim O'Neill** (Goldman Sachs) in **2001**; the **first BRIC Summit** was held at **Yekaterinburg, Russia, in 2009**."
  },
  {
   "book": 3,
   "row": 90,
   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Greenshoe option:** an over-allotment option that lets the issuer sell **extra shares** (usually up to 15% of the issue) when demand is high."
  }
 ],
 "doubtful": []
}